     A*  04/30/06  C: 132  PROJECT: WC1420                            *
     A*                    ADD additional fields to end of file found *
     A*                    missing during testing.                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  04/03/06  C: 132  PROJECT: WC1420                            *
     A*                    ADD multiple Fields to end of file for the *
     A*                    project                                    *
